#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Aither R7-C1 v2 benchmark harness — semantic operation model.

This replaces the v1 exact-string simulator with a typed semantic operation model.

Fixes (R8-BENCHMARK-REPAIR defect catalog D1-D8):
  D1/D4  exact-string matching -> typed semantic operations + shell semantic parser
  D2/D3  Kubernetes namespace/object identity -> full-dimension operation identity
  D5     error-classification contamination -> RELEVANT_NEGATIVE status
  D6     relevance != reveal -> separate relevance tracking
  D7/D8  (handled in preflight v2, separate)

Result/relevance model (Phase 5):
  RELEVANT_REVEAL | RELEVANT_NEGATIVE | IRRELEVANT | DUPLICATE | UNSAFE
  | MALFORMED | UNKNOWN_TOOL | SCHEMA_INVALID | UNSUPPORTED_SEMANTIC_OPERATION

Invariant: relevant != revealed.

Subcommands:
  selfcheck                 -> tool map + operation model smoke
  unittest <v2_scenarios>   -> >=100 deterministic simulator/evaluator tests
  evaltest <v2_scenarios>   -> evaluator self-tests
  route <v2_scenarios> <profile>   -> P0 router
  sim <v2_scenarios> <policy> [out_csv]  -> scripted policy run (positive/negative controls)
"""
